AWEN 0.1

PROJECT Awen Lang
OUTPUT language specification, documentation and assembly-sheet examples
ROOT .

SOURCES
  SPECIFICATION ./SPEC.md AUTHORITATIVE
  CONTRIBUTING ./CONTRIBUTING.md AUTHORITATIVE
  OVERVIEW ./README.md CONTEXT
  WORKFLOW ./WORKFLOW.md CONTEXT
  TOOLS ./TOOLS.md CONTEXT
  TEMPLATE ./TEMPLATE.awen CONTEXT
  EXAMPLES ./examples/README.md CONTEXT

REQUIRE
  keep SPEC.md authoritative for language semantics
  keep documentation, template and examples consistent with the specification
  preserve the small, declarative and AI-agnostic nature of Awen

EXECUTION
  INSTRUCTIONS ./AGENTS.md
  template and example sheets illustrate usage; their production tasks are not this repository's build

DONE WHEN
  the requested repository change is reflected consistently in affected documentation, template and examples
  repository documentation links resolve and illustrative project paths are identified as such
